    "['transport input ssh', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'stelnet server enable', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'stelnet server enable', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nstelnet server enable\\nssh server enable\\nuser-interface vty 0 4\\n authentication-mode aaa\\n protocol inbound ssh\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. \"stelnet server enable\" and \"ssh server enable\" are required on Huawei to enable SSH server functionality (equivalent to enabling SSH transport input on Cisco)\\n2. \"user-interface vty 0 4\" selects the VTY lines\\n3. \"authentication-mode aaa\" sets authentication to use local AAA (like Cisco\\'s \"login local\")\\n4. \"protocol inbound ssh\" restricts access to SSH only (equivalent to \"transport input ssh\")', 'trans_template': 'stelnet server enable'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'ssh server enable', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'ssh server enable', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nstelnet server enable\\nssh server enable\\nuser-interface vty 0 4\\n authentication-mode aaa\\n protocol inbound ssh\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. \"stelnet server enable\" and \"ssh server enable\" are required on Huawei to enable SSH server functionality (equivalent to enabling SSH transport input on Cisco)\\n2. \"user-interface vty 0 4\" selects the VTY lines\\n3. \"authentication-mode aaa\" sets authentication to use local AAA (like Cisco\\'s \"login local\")\\n4. \"protocol inbound ssh\" restricts access to SSH only (equivalent to \"transport input ssh\")', 'trans_template': 'ssh server enable'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'user-interface vty 0 4', 'parent_command': ['user-interface vty 0 4'], 'root': 'user-interface vty 0 4', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nstelnet server enable\\nssh server enable\\nuser-interface vty 0 4\\n authentication-mode aaa\\n protocol inbound ssh\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. \"stelnet server enable\" and \"ssh server enable\" are required on Huawei to enable SSH server functionality (equivalent